[thin] Required 1 mm-wide copper-cover flange bearing. These pairs cross the bearing sideways, between its slot edge and its shoulder; the cover's 1 mm overlap requires that span. The casing measured across X at the straight seats is 2.90 mm, and the flat seating plane remains the cover's fixed fit datum.
alternatives: Widening the bearing changes the cover's flange overlap and the slot-side stock. Removing or tapering it changes the retained cover fit. This local seating feature is separate from the ordinary 2.38 mm wall.
